---
import { intakeHref } from '../../data/site.js';

const href = intakeHref('en');
const linkAttrs = href.startsWith('http') ? { target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' } : {};
---
<!-- ═══ WHO WE WORK WITH ═══ -->
<section class="section" id="join">
    <p class="label">Who It Is For</p>
    <h2 class="section-h">Built for Every Innovator</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">Whether you come from the lab, the clinic, or the boardroom — we are designing the platform around what you need. This is what we plan to offer, and your input will decide what comes first.</p>
    <div class="audience-grid">

        <div class="audience-card" id="join-clinicians">
            <span class="audience-tag tag-clinical">Clinicians &amp; Researchers</span>
            <h3>You have the knowledge. We want to handle the rest.</h3>
            <p class="audience-hook">"My job is medicine, not business" — we hear that. And we agree.</p>
            <p class="audience-desc">You should not have to become an entrepreneur. You need a partner who can translate your clinical insight into a scalable solution. We are building the structure, legal setup, business mentoring, and capital connections for this — so you can stay focused on what you do best.</p>
            <ul class="audience-list">
                <li>Business development support</li>
                <li>IP protection and spin-off guidance</li>
                <li>A route to clinical validation at FN Olomouc</li>
                <li>Connections to investors and industry partners</li>
            </ul>
            <a href={href} class="audience-cta" {...linkAttrs}>Tell us what you need →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="audience-card" id="join-startups">
            <span class="audience-tag tag-startup">Startups &amp; Innovators</span>
            <h3>Validate in a real hospital. Scale with confidence.</h3>
            <p class="audience-hook">"We have the product — we need clinical proof."</p>
            <p class="audience-desc">Clinical validation is the hardest and most valuable step in MedTech. Through TafelVent Gate we want to open FN Olomouc for structured pilots, access to anonymised data within legal frameworks, and co-development with clinicians and researchers.</p>
            <ul class="audience-list">
                <li>Structured clinical pilots</li>
                <li>Access to anonymised data and cohorts</li>
                <li>Co-development with clinical specialists</li>
                <li>Guidance on regulatory and reimbursement pathways</li>
            </ul>
            <a href={href} class="audience-cta" {...linkAttrs}>Tell us what you need →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="audience-card" id="join-investors">
            <span class="audience-tag tag-investor">Investors &amp; Capital Partners</span>
            <h3>Deal flow from the heart of clinical practice.</h3>
            <p class="audience-hook">"Where do I find validated MedTech opportunities in Central Europe?"</p>
            <p class="audience-desc">Projects in our future pipeline will be assessed by clinicians, tested against real patient needs, and checked for commercial viability. We want to connect venture funds, family offices, and angel investors with innovations that have a real hospital behind them.</p>
            <ul class="audience-list">
                <li>Clinically assessed deal flow</li>
                <li>Co-investment alongside public grants</li>
                <li>Early access to spin-off projects</li>
                <li>Strategic partnership opportunities</li>
            </ul>
            <a href={href} class="audience-cta" {...linkAttrs}>Tell us what you need →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="audience-card" id="join-industry">
            <span class="audience-tag tag-industry">Industry &amp; Corporate Partners</span>
            <h3>A direct route to clinical co-development.</h3>
            <p class="audience-hook">"We need a real hospital partner for our innovation pipeline."</p>
            <p class="audience-desc">We want to give Pharma, MedTech, Digital Health, and Life Sciences companies a structured gateway into FN Olomouc, one of the Czech Republic's leading university hospitals — to pilot technologies, run studies, or co-develop solutions with clinical teams under clear rules.</p>
            <ul class="audience-list">
                <li>Clear frameworks for industry collaboration</li>
                <li>Access to clinical departments and data</li>
                <li>Joint R&amp;D and grant applications</li>
                <li>Support for regional market entry</li>
            </ul>
            <a href={href} class="audience-cta" {...linkAttrs}>Tell us what you need →</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>
